<view class="ui-page apply-page"><text class="ui-kicker">元享 · 好物体验</text><text class="ui-title">给喜欢一个机会。</text><text class="ui-lead">确认活动信息，自主报名参加。</text>
 <yx-state wx:if="{{loading&&!loaded}}" type="loading"/><yx-state wx:elif="{{error&&!loaded}}" type="error" title="活动信息暂时无法读取" description="{{error}}" action="重新加载" bindaction="retry"/>
 <block wx:elif="{{loaded}}"><view class="apply-product ui-card"><image wx:if="{{trial_show.pro_picurl}}" src="{{trial_show.pro_picurl}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view wx:else class="apply-placeholder"><yx-icon name="gift" tone="muted" size="70"/></view><text>{{trial_show.pro_title}}</text></view>
 <view class="apply-rules ui-card"><view class="apply-heading"><yx-icon name="info" tone="brand" size="40"/><text>报名前，请了解</text></view><view><text>01</text><text>报名不等于中选，结果以活动公布为准。</text></view><view><text>02</text><text>报名阶段无需填写收货地址。</text></view><view><text>03</text><text>中选后，再自主填写本次活动所需的收货资料。</text></view></view>
 <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="ui-error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{!canApply&&!submissionUnknown&&!applicationSubmitted}}" class="ui-muted">{{applyLabel}}。请返回活动详情核对最新状态后参与。</view><button wx:if="{{!canApply&&!submissionUnknown&&!applicationSubmitted}}" class="ui-text-button" bindtap="retry" disabled="{{loading}}">刷新活动状态</button><button class="ui-primary" bindtap="resQuick" disabled="{{submitting||loading||submissionUnknown||!canApply}}" loading="{{submitting}}">{{submissionUnknown?'请先核对报名结果':submitting?'正在提交':applyLabel}}</button><navigator wx:if="{{submissionUnknown||applicationSubmitted}}" class="ui-secondary apply-records" open-type="redirect" url="/sage_dksy/pages/user/trial_list">查看试用申请记录</navigator><button class="ui-text-button" bindtap="goBack" disabled="{{submitting}}">返回活动</button></block>
</view>
